trong>: SEO, targeted social ads, updated Google listings</p></li><li><p><strong>Video Storytelling</strong>: Facility tours, staff intros (authenticity &gt; polish)</p></li><li><p><strong>Events</strong>: Free screenings position you as community resource</p></li><li><p><strong>Email Personalization</strong>: Segmented lists with patient names/recent visits</p></li><li><p><strong>Testimonials</strong>: Feature reviews; send easy review links</p></li><li><p><strong>Track Metrics</strong>: Monthly review engagement, traffic, conversions</p></li><li><p><strong>Content Calendar</strong>: Plan educational/practice updates monthly</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"tiptap-heading\"><strong>Key Takeaway</strong></h2><p>Unique campaigns build lasting impressions over generic ads. <strong>Data + consistency + community focus</strong> = patient growth. Partner with experts for HIPAA-compliant execution.</p>",
